  "description": "A 13-item measure of how pain affects thoughts and feelings — rumination, magnification, and helplessness. Higher scores predict worse surgical outcomes; ≥30 indicates clinically relevant catastrophizing and supports adding pain-psychology and pelvic-floor PT to the plan.",
